  "description": "The meme's humor is derived from the incongruity of comparing a political body to a group of baboons, which is inherently degrading and mocking. This comparison can be seen as subtly undermining the dignity of democratic institutions by likening them to animals, which may contribute to a broader culture of disrespect toward politics.",
